### ==============================================================================
### TEST REQUESTS: VIETMART API GATEWAY ROUTING
### ==============================================================================
### Gateway Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### Eureka Dashboard: http://localhost:8761

### 1. Test Eureka Registry Status (Kiểm tra trạng thái Service Discovery)
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Test Product Service Route (Lấy chi tiết sản phẩm ID 1 qua API Gateway)
### Kỳ vọng: Gateway khớp route 'product-service-route' -> LoadBalancer chọn product-service instance -> HTTP 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Test Voucher Service Route (Tra cứu mã giảm giá summer2026 qua API Gateway)
### Kỳ vọng: Gateway khớp route 'voucher-service-route' -> LoadBalancer chọn voucher-service instance -> HTTP 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vouchers/summer2026
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Test Route không tồn tại (Kiểm tra hành vi khi predicate không khớp)
### Kỳ vọng: Gateway không tìm thấy route khớp -> Trả về HTTP 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/unknown-endpoint
Accept: application/json
